@startuml
!pragma layout smetana
title v0.6 - Three gardens, archived learning and independent writing
class Learner {
  schemaVersion = 3
  characterId
  nickname
  activeJourneyId
}
class JourneyProgress {
  journeyId
  completedChallengeIds: unique
  keyOrKeepsakeIds: unique
  checkpoint
  optionalPracticePlan
}
class Garden {
  gardenId
  fiveOrderedChallengeIds
  videoSegmentId
  keyId
}
class Exploration {
  challengeId
  selectedChoice
  completed
}
class Writing {
  canonicalPromptId
  draftOrSavedText
  independentSourceMetadata
}
class PreviousTazkiya {
  version = 0.5
  oldStageCatalog
  preservedProgress
}
class VideoProgress {
  stableSegmentId
  positionSeconds
  completed
}
Learner *-- "2" JourneyProgress
Learner *-- "*" Writing
Learner *-- "0..1" PreviousTazkiya
JourneyProgress *-- "*" Exploration
JourneyProgress *-- "*" VideoProgress
Garden "3" --> "15 total" Exploration
note bottom of Writing
May outlive its source stage.
Optional, device-local, editable and deletable.
end note
note bottom of Exploration
Any explored response permits continuation.
Correctness does not measure the child.
end note
@enduml
